<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>404 — Link Not Found | SnapLink</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@700;800&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --bg:       #0a0a09;
      --surface:  #141413;
      --border:   #2a2a28;
      --text:     #f0f0ee;
      --muted:    #666662;
      --accent:   #FAC775;
      --accent2:  #5DCAA5;
      --danger:   #F09595;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    /* Animated background grid */
    .bg-grid {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(250,199,117,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(250,199,117,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 60px 60px;
      animation: gridMove 20s linear infinite;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    @keyframes gridMove {
      0%   { transform: translateY(0); }
      100% { transform: translateY(60px); }
    }

    /* Glow blobs */
    .blob {
      position: fixed;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(80px);
      opacity: 0.12;
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: blobFloat 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    .blob-1 {
      width: 400px; height: 400px;
      background: var(--accent);
      top: -100px; left: -100px;
      animation-delay: 0s;
    }
    .blob-2 {
      width: 300px; height: 300px;
      background: var(--danger);
      bottom: -80px; right: -80px;
      animation-delay: 3s;
    }
    @keyframes blobFloat {
      from { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
      to   { transform: translate(30px, 20px) scale(1.1); }
    }

    /* Main content */
    .container {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      max-width: 520px;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease both;
    }
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* Broken link visual */
    .icon-wrap {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .chain {
      font-size: 42px;
      display: inline-block;
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .chain-left {
      animation: chainLeft 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
      transform-origin: right center;
    }
    .chain-right {
      animation: chainRight 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
      transform-origin: left center;
    }
    .chain-break {
      width: 14px;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--danger);
      border-radius: 99px;
      position: relative;
      top: -2px;
      animation: breakPulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes chainLeft {
      from { transform: rotate(-8deg) translateX(0); }
      to   { transform: rotate(0deg) translateX(-4px); }
    }
    @keyframes chainRight {
      from { transform: rotate(8deg) translateX(0); }
      to   { transform: rotate(0deg) translateX(4px); }
    }
    @keyframes breakPulse {
      0%,100% { opacity: 1; width: 14px; }
      50%     { opacity: 0.3; width: 20px; }
    }

    /* 404 number */
    .error-code {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(6rem, 20vw, 10rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 0.9;
      letter-spacing: -4px;
      color: transparent;
      -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px var(--border);
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      user-select: none;
    }
    .error-code::after {
      content: '404';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      color: var(--accent);
      -webkit-text-stroke: 0;
      clip-path: polygon(0 50%, 100% 50%, 100% 100%, 0 100%);
      animation: fillUp 2.5s ease forwards;
    }
    @keyframes fillUp {
      from { clip-path: polygon(0 100%, 100% 100%, 100% 100%, 0 100%); }
      to   { clip-path: polygon(0 50%, 100% 50%, 100% 100%, 0 100%); }
    }

    /* Text */
    .title {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.2s ease both;
    }
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.35s ease both;
    }

    /* URL pill */
    .url-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 99px;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-family: monospace;
      color: var(--danger);
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.45s ease both;
    }
    .url-dot {
      width: 6px; height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--danger);
      animation: blink 1.2s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes blink { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:0.2} }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.55s ease both;
    }
    .btn {
      padding: 11px 24px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #1a1a18;
      border: none;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #f5bb55;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
    .btn-ghost {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover {
      border-color: var(--muted);
      color: var(--text);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* Bottom tag */
    .bottom-tag {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 1.5rem;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: monospace;
      animation: fadeUp 1s 0.8s ease both;
      opacity: 0;
    }
    .bottom-tag span { color: var(--accent2); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="bg-grid"></div>
  <div class="blob blob-1"></div>
  <div class="blob blob-2"></div>

  <div class="container">

    <div class="icon-wrap">
      <span class="chain chain-left">🔗</span>
      <div class="chain-break"></div>
      <span class="chain chain-right">🔗</span>
    </div>

    <div class="error-code">404</div>

    <div class="title">Yeh link toot gaya!</div>
    <div class="subtitle">
      Jo short URL tune open kiya woh exist nahi karta,<br>
      ya delete ho chuka hai. Double check karo!
    </div>

    <div class="url-pill">
      <div class="url-dot"></div>
      Link not found
    </div>

    <div class="btn-group">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">
        ← Wapas jao
      </a>
      <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-ghost">
        Dashboard
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="bottom-tag">snaplink.fun — <span>URL- Shortener</span></div>

</body>
</html>
